CB012149-SR-AC_ET_10_01_intra gnb handover to TDD cell with A1 based CA and HO back select normal BC
    [Documentation]
    ...     == Requirement: ==
    ...     USCB012149-AC#B4
    ...     Measurement gap configuration support for UE with UL Tx Switching configured.
    ...
    ...     == Precondition: ==
    ...     GNB:
    ...         CB012149 enabled, ulTxSwitchingBoost=2
    ...         CB009169 enabled
    ...
    ...         FDD Cell-14: Band: N71; chBw=10MHz; nrarfcnDl=129000, nrarfcnUl=138200, GSCN=1611
    ...         FDD Cell-12: Band: N71; chBw=10MHz; nrarfcnDl=126900, nrarfcnUl=136100, GSCN=1587
    ...         FDD Cell-11: Band: N66; chBw=20MHz; nrarfcnDl=424000, nrarfcnUl=344000, GSCN=5297
    ...         FDD Cell-13: Band: N66; chBw=30MHz; nrarfcnDl=430920, nrarfcnUl=350920, GSCN=5385
    ...         TDD Cell-1: Band: N41; chBw=80MHz; nrarfcn=518598, GSCN=6480
    ...         TDD Cell-2: Band: N78; chBw=70MHz; nrarfcn=636666, GSCN=7880
    ...
    ...         NRBTS/NRDU-1:dlToUlContributionRatio=50
    ...         NRCELL:weightForSCellSelection=50
    ...         NRCELL-1:tddFrameStructure:frameStructureType=semiStatic
    ...         NRCELL-1:tddFrameStructure:ulDlDataSlotRatio=3/7
    ...         NRCELL-2:tddFrameStructure:frameStructureType=semiStatic
    ...         NRCELL-2:tddFrameStructure:ulDlDataSlotRatio=3/7
    ...         #with above config, FDD scell follow 5GC001070, which uplink bandwidth need multiplies 0.6
    ...
    ...     UE:
    ...         Notes: below bandwidth calculation result is based on below preconditions:
    ...            1. ignore dlToUlContributionRatio and weightForSCellSelection due to their value both 50.
    ...            2. no calculate TDD Pcell downlink uplink bandwidth due to they all same, except for the ulTxSwitchingBoost.
    ...
    ...         normal BC:
    ...             BC#1: N41a*-N66a-N66a*=68
    ...             BC#2: N41a*-N66a*-N71a-N71a*=68
    ...             BC#3: N41a*-N71a-N78a=10[rsrp<TDD threshold] | 59[rsrp>TDD threshold]
    ...             BC#4: N41a*-N66a*-N78a*=48[rsrp<TDD threshold] | 97[rsrp>TDD threshold]
    ...         ultxswitch BC:
    ...             pair1:
    ...             uplinkTxSwitchingPeriod-r16 n140us
    ...             uplinkTxSwitching-DL-Interruption-r16 not present
    ...             pair2:
    ...             uplinkTxSwitchingPeriod-r16 n210us
    ...             uplinkTxSwitching-DL-Interruption-r16 not present
    ...             uplinkTxSwitching-OptionSupport-r16 switchedUL
    ...             BC#1: N41a*-N78a [invalid]
    ...             BC#2: N41a*-N66a*-N71a*=82
    ...             BC#3: N41a*-N71a*-N78a=40[rsrp<TDD threshold] | 89[rsrp>TDD threshold]
    ...             BC#4: N78a*-N66a*-N71a*=79[only valid when cell-2 as pcell]
    ...
    ...     == Test steps: ==
    ...     step1. UE1 attach to cell-1, drx is installed with drxprofile1
    ...     step2. report A1 with rsrp<a1ThresholdSCellAddSsbRsrpTDD, cell-13 and cell-14 are configured as scell,
    ...            scell cell-13 is configured with UL switch CA.
    ...     step3. report A2, A3 is configured, drx released and gap installed
    ...     step4. report A3, UE1 handover from cell-1 to cell-2.
    ...     step5. report A1 with rsrp<a1ThresholdSCellAddSsbRsrpTDD, cell-12 and cell-13 are configured as scell.
    ...     step6. report A2, A3, UE1 handover from cell-2 to cell-1.
    ...     step7. report A1 with rsrp>a1ThresholdSCellAddSsbRsrpTDD, cell-13 and cell-2 are configured as scell.
    ...            scell cell-13 is configured with normal UL CA.
