    Send A1 report to trigger Scell Addition with RSRP55    ue_id=1    cell_freq=${Cell1_ssbFrequency}
    Send A2 A3 report to trigger intra-gnb handover to TDD cell-2
    Send A1 report to trigger Scell Addition with RSRP55    ue_id=1    cell_freq=${Cell2_ssbFrequency}
    Send A2 A3 report to trigger intra-gnb handover to TDD cell-1
    Send A1 report to trigger Scell Addition with RSRP61    ue_id=1    cell_freq=${Cell1_ssbFrequency}
    Check RRC Log    ${CURDIR}${/}A2A_AC_case10${/}a2a.ini

